    "2. Encoder. {'BioMedCLIP is a general biomedical encoder, not a knee-MRI foundation model.' if REAL_TEXT_SPACE else 'A STUB random-projection encoder was used: the text-alignment and question-routing results are plumbing only.'}\n",
    "3. Geometry. One pooled embedding per 2-D slice discards the 3-D, multi-slice, multi-sequence\n",
